-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §9: in a school the reform is applied to,
-- every teaching employee is employed under the reform from that school
-- year, save the non-academic teachers §51(א)(2) applies to and the
-- substitutes §13 keeps off it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `9`

-- §51(א)(2) (a non-academic who has not signed the undertaking to complete
-- a degree) and §13 (a substitute's terms) are encoded in their own
-- sections; here they are inputs.
@ref akn:art_9
GIVEN `the school is under the reform this year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a non-academic section 51(א)(2) keeps off the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a substitute section 13 keeps off the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed under the reform under section 9` `the school is under the reform this year` `a non-academic section 51(א)(2) keeps off the reform` `a substitute section 13 keeps off the reform` IF
        `the school is under the reform this year`
    AND NOT `a non-academic section 51(א)(2) keeps off the reform`
    AND NOT `a substitute section 13 keeps off the reform`

#ASSERT `employed under the reform under section 9` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `employed under the reform under section 9` TRUE TRUE FALSE
